{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e5f64c46-df76-8247-ac3b-f06f74e365c1",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T09:39:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonella Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:35:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. I'm calling about a yard sale. Do I have to register it? Is there a, a registration for the yard sale?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:35:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a yard sale. Let me make sure I have that right. You want to know if you need to register a yard sale at your home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:35:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, at my house. I'm on Farewell Street, number 190, up in the North End. I have so much stuff in the garage, you wouldn't believe it. Boxes, boxes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:35:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Generally, yes, the city does ask for a yard sale registration, so you'd want to fill that out before you hold the sale. Are you planning it soon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:35:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, not till spring. The weather! After last weekend's storm, the snow and then the rain, Sunday into Monday, everything is slush. So spring, yes. But I want to know the paperwork now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:35:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Plenty of time, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:36:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the fee? Is there a fee for the registration?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:36:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, and I don't want to give you the wrong number. Let me look at the fee schedule. Can you hold for just a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:36:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I can hold. Oh, wait. Wait, I should say, I'm standing in line at the bakery counter right now. If I step out I lose my place. So I'm here, I'm just talking quiet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, stay right where you are. I'll be a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. [pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:36:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting. I'm looking at it now. So the yard sale registration does have a small fee, and it's handled through our office. Is it a one-day sale or a weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:36:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A weekend, I think. Saturday and Sunday. Is it per day? Or per sale? I don't understand how they count the sale."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:37:00-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Let me read this carefully. It's per registration, not per item, and the form asks for the dates you'll hold it. Whether a two-day sale counts as one, I want to confirm with the licensing staff. I can have someone call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:37:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the fee is one fee, or two fees? I'm sorry, I'm confused. Per registration, per day..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:37:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair, it's not clear the way it's written. I'll put it this way: you register once, listing both dates. What I can't tell you yet is whether the fee is charged once or per day. I'll find out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the form, where do I get the form? Online? Or I come to City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can pick one up here at the clerk's office at City Hall, and I believe it's also on the city website. Either way works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:37:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the website. I'm not good with the website, but my niece... no, never mind. I'll come in. Do I need to bring a, a license? Proof of the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring an ID, and it helps to have your address handy, which you've already told me. Beyond that, the form will tell you what it wants."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh! The line moved. Okay, I'm next, almost. So, you will call me back about the fee? One fee or two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Let me take your number. What's the best one for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0166. And that's Antonella, is that right? Can you spell the last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Antonella. Pellegrino. P-E-L-L-E-G-R-I-N-O. Two L's, two L's in the middle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, two L's. Pellegrino. I'll have someone call you back today or tomorrow about whether the fee is per sale or per day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I register first, then the sale. Not the sale, then register."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:39:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Register first, then hold the sale."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:39:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Owen. I think I understand. Mostly. I have to go, it's my turn, the pastry lady is looking at me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:39:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, enjoy. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
